# Gallery Images
# Place all gallery images here using the naming convention: image1, image2, image3, etc.
# Supported formats: .jpg, .jpeg, .png (checked in that order)
# Example: image1.jpg, image2.png, image3.jpeg, image4.JPEG, etc.
# Images are loaded sequentially and the gallery stops after 3 consecutive missing images
# All images are displayed together in a grid - no split between sim and real content
# Images can be of varying sizes

